#   run 44985066077: APKPure lists 63 versions (1.85.8 to 3.5.3), 3.4.3
#     among them; no x86_64 build of it. Run 3: arm64-v8a, x86_64 optional.
#   run 44985566401: 3.4.3 arm64-v8a and 1.85.8 downloaded; the base APK did
#     not verify (apksigner). Run 4 prints apksigner's reason.
#   run 44985917683: it VERIFIES (v2, v3; signer CN=Kim Jae hyun, O=MX
