# 22 Nov 2026 (later still): MODE=panels — Phase 1. MX and Innocent's
# x86_64 lab build of this commit, the ⋮, ♪ and CC panels, upright and
# sideways (the lab fixes the rotation: wm set-fix-to-user-rotation), over
# a black and a white frame; tool/ref/measure.py and compare.py. Compare
# with nothing earlier: the first measurement.
#   run 44991688519: no panel measured; three faults of the lab's, each
#     fixed. dumpsys activity top lists the launcher's task first and the
#     tree was taken from it (ui.py hier now takes PACKAGE's). Innocent's
