# on a 1600x2560 screen at 320 dpi (800x1280 dp, a 10" tablet), to see how
# far MX's panels reach there before Innocent's tablet reach is decided.
# Does MX's XAPK install at that density (its splits)? BACK TO 1080x2316 at
# 450 after this run.
#   run 45828625924: it installs (xxxhdpi split); all 24 screens. MX's
#     panels are 480 dp both ways (37.5 %), upright the full width, content
