# 26 Nov 2026 (night): THE OWNER — "⋮ as MX's: 11 tiles and More", and
# "every shortcut as MX's: what it does and the screen it brings, exactly".
# SCREENS=shortcuts (probe.sh shortcut_screens): back on the owner's phone
# (1080x2316, 450 dpi), sideways over black; both apps' expanded row, each
# shortcut tapped from a fresh open (its panel taken and closed, or a
