# 26 Nov 2026 (late): Innocent's build with ⋮ as MX's (ten tiles, More ›),
# the shortcuts in MX's order, the speed card, the A-B bar, Night mode
# grey. Same screens again: Innocent's new ones beside MX's.
#   run 45870615457: Innocent's open row in MX's order, the speed card, the
#     A-B bar, Night mode grey, ⋮'s ten tiles and More, beside MX's.
# 26 Nov 2026 (late night): Innocent with MX's controls geometry (row,
# discs, ⏮ ⏯ ⏭, lock, times), the panels on the shade, the tablet reach.
# SCREENS=panels: the 24 panel screens and both apps' controls trees, for
# tool/ref/controls.py (Innocent - MX in dp) and measure.py. Then
# SCREENS=shortcuts for the Customise card, Sleep, AE/EQ and the toasts.
#   run 45885319037: SCREENS=panels. controls.py: Innocent - MX within
#     0.5 dp for the seek bar, times, lock, ⏮ ⏯ ⏭, screen mode, the row's
#     pitch; the top bar 3.9 dp low sideways, ← and HW of other widths.
# Then SCREENS=shortcuts on the same build (run 45886561831): Innocent's
# Customise card, Sleep and AE/EQ on the shade, the toasts at the foot.
# Now SCREENS=panels again: the top bar as MX's (48 high sideways, ← 56,
# HW 48, ⋮ 56 upright) and the row 4 dp up sideways.
#   run 45892311848: that build (421fb8ed).
#   run 45886561831 (shortcuts) showed MX's Customise Items is an edit
#     view (the controls stay, dimmed film, dashed boxes; Popup Window and
#     Zoom the bottom row's), its Sleep × clears the entry, its toasts sit
#     24 dp up. Built after it.
# Then SCREENS=shortcuts: Innocent's edit view, Sleep and toasts beside MX's.
MODE=panels
SCREENS=subgest
MX_PACKAGE=com.mxtech.videoplayer.ad
MX_VERSION=3.4.3
# MX's signing certificate (SHA-256), read in run 44985917683 from 3.4.3,
# whose Google Play source stamp verified. Any later version fetched must
# carry the same.
MX_CERT=0d9b4c778672e753d45aba4f10df31e1d10bf75b1245469131ef01b82f0f91b6
# The file MODE=probe installs: the release mx-<version> of innocent-ref,
# its size and SHA-256 as GitHub recorded them at upload (get_release_by_tag,
# 22 Nov). probe.sh refuses any other file.
MX_ASSET=mx-3.4.3-arm64-v8a.xapk
MX_SIZE=67788927
MX_SHA256=6f877a3d482e2213b9abb25a0a8c6497e036181339aa1540d21e5635ef4a13bf
# The emulator for MODE=probe: an x86_64 image that translates ARM, and the
# owner's screen (about 384x823 dp).
PROBE_API=30
PROBE_TARGET=google_apis
PROBE_SIZE=1080x2316
PROBE_DPI=450
